<!--
  A woman's head in profile, with curly hair — what a breastfeed is marked with.

  A person rather than a body part on purpose: this sits in a shared log, on a day line, on a
  phone that gets handed around, and a face reads as "her feed" without reading as anatomy.
  Same 24dp grid and untinted fill as the bottle beside it.
-->
